abstract: Independent model-stage replay scripts for grouped-binomial pharmacovigilance
  models and derived aggregate validation results from FAERS/AERS, JADER, and Canada
  Vigilance. Restricted quarterly grouped inputs and full regulatory preprocessing
  code are not supplied.
